  "description": "Yaariyan is the soundtrack album to the 2014 film of the same name directed by Divya Khosla Kumar and produced by T-Series Films. The album featured 13 songs composed by an assortment of musicians, which include: Pritam, Mithoon, Yo Yo Honey Singh, Arko and Anupam Amod, with lyrics written by Amitabh Bhattacharya, Irshad Kamil, Mithoon, Singh and Arko. The album was released through T-Series on 3 December 2013.",
